      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are square matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $F$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $3$ rows and $4$ columns, so it's a $3\\times 4$ matrix.\n\n- $R$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $2$ rows and $2$ columns, so it is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\n- $W$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $2$ rows and $4$ columns, so it's a $2\\times 4$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, only $R$ is a square matrix.",
