      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are square matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $M$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $4$ rows and $3$ columns, so it's a $4\\times 3$ matrix.\n\n- $W$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $2$ rows and $3$ columns, so it's a $2\\times 3$ matrix.\n\n- $Z$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $1$ row and $1$ column, so it is a $1\\times 1$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, only $Z$ is a square matrix.",
